There are a lot of details which should be asked to find out if 
everything is correctly configured and there might many reasons why the 
connection isn't working.
Therefore it would be best to look into the X server log file. There you 
should find information why your client cannot connect to the server.
Check the following logs:
$HOME/.xsession-errors
/usr/lib/X11/xdm-errors

You'll find a lot of information in the online manual:
http://h30097.www3.hp.com/docs/base_doc/DOCUMENTATION/V51B_HTML/ARH9JCTE/SYSDMNCH.HTM




